        {
          "book": "JDG",
          "chapter": 8,
          "verse": 11
        }
      ],
      "en": "Gideon went up by the way of those who lived in tents on the east of Nobah and Jogbehah, and struck the army; for the army felt secure.",
      "ko": "적군이 안연히 있는 중에 기드온이 노바와 욕브하 동편 장막에 거한 자의 길로 올라가서 적군을 치니",
      "source_text_hash": "9fc9e51b1c62937aab8d1cf14ea2c4c2fb82a456743a110842d4c8bd1e7257ec",
      "translation_text_hash": "faf0d67cc854c0bf5df3f0e1c6a55add77a5e7cad5ce8122233f3744522146e5",
