        {
          "book": "JDG",
          "chapter": 8,
          "verse": 18
        }
      ],
      "en": "Then he said to Zebah and Zalmunna, “What kind of men were they whom you killed at Tabor?” They answered, “They were like you. They all resembled the children of a king.”",
      "ko": "이에 세바와 살문나에게 묻되 너희가 다볼에서 죽인 자들은 어떠한 자이더뇨 대답하되 그들이 너와 같아서 모두 왕자 같더라",
      "source_text_hash": "67bd0cd2c9c6b3c8eb53bd382f1125a03d78b94cebadb5e83c522c02827c8fc6",
      "translation_text_hash": "508ffb791ccd73fa9e91f5738aa1efb7e896e30fce77400f7447d45d41d17335",
