      "en": "The children of Israel didn’t remember the LORD their God, who had delivered them out of the hand of all their enemies on every side;",
      "ko": "사면 모든 대적의 손에서 자기들을 건져내신 여호와 자기들의 하나님을 기억지 아니하며",
      "source_text_hash": "48c4cee23f5e77ff0e7b0feee7dcd2601183bd5b4e3d2384d1032dde0f4d58e0",
      "translation_text_hash": "3b426461434e2ef70b5b493188a3a2063285339c6d56cf878104258af07b0981",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
